{"title":"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d5efb4e97232da0bd50cb0824db92354036851b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&gt;B&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"85\" height=\"13\" /> and A is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />% greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bcf5201ac27a5f555ca611c68212982c334a9b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf {(A) } 100\\left(\\frac{A-B}{B}\\right) \\qquad \\textbf {(B) } 100\\left(\\frac{A+B}{B}\\right) \\qquad \\textbf {(C) } 100\\left(\\frac{A+B}{A}\\right)\\qquad \\textbf {(D) } 100\\left(\\frac{A-B}{A}\\right) \\qquad \\textbf {(E) } 100\\left(\\frac{A}{B}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"835\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have that A is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/e/8de1a36d69a7028480a87b712a7141c651398a06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> greater than B, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fc5e007ebe1fd6ece6cb3487ab43bfd9733bd09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=\\frac{100+x}{100}(B)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"129\" height=\"38\" />. We solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. We get \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/4/9a471f49b8d86835e4947139b49ccd546695c5ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{A}{B}=\\frac{100+x}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/0/0e057bd098362fd14f7cb1d9438d9ca177401013.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\frac{A}{B}=100+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"129\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/b/6cbf92f7a27015f88e710f75841fe8c6f1c9bbb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\left(\\frac{A}{B}-1\\right)=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"140\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/7/b571f03f56675dc632ca497e0e0a6eb587c89094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\left(\\frac{A-B}{B}\\right)=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"145\" height=\"43\" />.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/b/d9bb12a9e2ef9af0469e2e502cd27a96a1cc82b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\left(\\textbf{A}\\right)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"40\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The question is basically asking the percentage increase from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. We know the formula for percentage increase is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/3/9d346076bb76c4d1e9b8ac8f7126b50e0d1fcbdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\text{New-Original}}{\\text{Original}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"98\" height=\"40\" />. We know the new is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and the original is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. We also must multiple by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> out of it's fractional/decimal form. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/f/75fec0ae229e28d4ef480a785182397c8a4e3f94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\left(\\frac{A-B}{B}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"107\" height=\"43\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79e0e8ce41b5c08729443bcc258d13ca061ff35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Without loss of generality, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/3/1b3636220c80d994093ac3d6eefbc18da8189b5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/b/bdb0154bd2b86f91c962eb56986e82e8521494a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 100,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> forcing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Plugging our values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> into these answer choices, we find that only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" /> returns <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/NTqYTNTU130\">https://youtu.be/NTqYTNTU130</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jj_rRTuWL14\">https://youtu.be/jj_rRTuWL14</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B\">2014 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<